      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux Device Model",
      "source_hash": 6403174492555944377,
      "context_hash": 6898304058076166210,
      "translation": "Linux 디바이스 모델",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "device model": "디바이스 모델"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329530Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The object-oriented framework that organizes all kernel devices",
      "source_hash": 7474016137924600575,
      "context_hash": 3495663988667245217,
      "translation": "모든 커널 디바이스를 조직하는 객체 지향 프레임워크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Why the device model exists",
      "source_hash": 10623432669847347071,
      "context_hash": 11778659491201907933,
      "translation": "디바이스 모델이 존재하는 이유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device model": "디바이스 모델"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before 2.6, each bus subsystem (PCI, USB, SCSI) independently managed power, hotplug, and sysfs.",
      "source_hash": 11986341865041016044,
      "context_hash": 3420183433186955338,
      "translation": "2.6 이전에는 각 버스 서브시스템(PCI, USB, SCSI)이 전원, 핫플러그, sysfs를 독자적으로 관리했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PCI": "PCI",
        "USB": "USB",
        "hotplug": "핫플러그",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템",
        "sysfs": "sysfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The device model (introduced in 2.5 by Patrick Mochel [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/31185/)) unified this into a single framework:",
      "source_hash": 12154401236336406343,
      "context_hash": 1811891319074031129,
      "translation": "디바이스 모델(2.5에서 Patrick Mochel이 도입 [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/31185/))은 이를 하나의 프레임워크로 통합했습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "device model": "디바이스 모델"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Power management**: suspend/resume traverse the device tree in order",
      "source_hash": 168113246438363722,
      "context_hash": 17610481716633093856,
      "translation": "**전원 관리**: suspend/resume이 디바이스 트리를 순서대로 순회",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Hotplug**: consistent uevent notifications for adding/removing devices",
      "source_hash": 11782990468288520425,
      "context_hash": 9501962572373153324,
      "translation": "**핫플러그**: 디바이스 추가/제거에 대한 일관된 uevent 알림",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "hotplug": "핫플러그"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**sysfs**: every device and driver automatically appears in `/sys/` (sysfs was written by Patrick Mochel during the 2.5 cycle and shipped with Linux 2.6.0 [(kernel docs)](https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/filesystems/sysfs.html))",
      "source_hash": 1846419221830902009,
      "context_hash": 2118616127970120278,
      "translation": "**sysfs**: 모든 디바이스와 드라이버가 자동으로 `/sys/`에 나타남(sysfs는 2.5 개발 주기 동안 Patrick Mochel이 작성했으며 Linux 2.6.0과 함께 출시됨 [(커널 문서)](https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/filesystems/sysfs.html))",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Kernel docs": "커널 문서",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "driver": "드라이버",
        "sysfs": "sysfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Reference counting**: devices live exactly as long as they're needed",
      "source_hash": 17415996152475717346,
      "context_hash": 3563478429313391291,
      "translation": "**참조 카운팅**: 디바이스는 필요한 동안에만 정확히 유지됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "kobject: the base object",
      "source_hash": 2147003998774926576,
      "context_hash": 18041467685447857975,
      "translation": "kobject: 기반 객체",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Every kernel object that appears in sysfs has a `kobject`:",
      "source_hash": 11919295328401584594,
      "context_hash": 992019040457467190,
      "translation": "sysfs에 나타나는 모든 커널 객체는 `kobject`를 가집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel object": "커널 객체",
        "sysfs": "sysfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329531Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Reference counting:",
      "source_hash": 13548975709763078963,
      "context_hash": 2369435822206030011,
