    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The match and probe flow",
      "source_hash": 12886329168067004831,
      "context_hash": 3004603748110818225,
      "translation": "match 및 probe 흐름",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329532Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a device is registered (or a driver is registered), the bus iterates all drivers (or devices) calling `bus->match()`.",
      "source_hash": 13010785921068926858,
      "context_hash": 364647765029893489,
      "translation": "디바이스가 등록되면(또는 드라이버가 등록되면) 버스는 모든 드라이버(또는 디바이스)를 순회하며 `bus->match()`를 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "devices": "디바이스",
        "driver": "드라이버",
        "drivers": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329532Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "On a match, `driver_probe_device()` is called:",
      "source_hash": 15705872079478916607,
      "context_hash": 16037110853242565433,
      "translation": "일치하면 `driver_probe_device()`가 호출됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329532Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "sysfs attributes",
      "source_hash": 15033159812303167947,
      "context_hash": 17423376470191205094,
      "translation": "sysfs 속성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "sysfs": "sysfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329532Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Drivers and devices expose attributes (files) in sysfs:",
      "source_hash": 16347459005050886804,
      "context_hash": 912530328657328897,
      "translation": "드라이버와 디바이스는 sysfs에 속성(파일)을 노출합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "sysfs": "sysfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329532Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "uevent: hotplug notification",
      "source_hash": 7048994509837629411,
      "context_hash": 17331581411878866619,
      "translation": "uevent: 핫플러그 알림",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hotplug": "핫플러그"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329532Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When devices are added/removed, the kernel sends uevents to userspace (received by `udevd`/`systemd-udevd`):",
      "source_hash": 6069272746652836468,
      "context_hash": 2238590109454660640,
      "translation": "디바이스가 추가/제거되면 커널은 사용자 공간으로 uevent를 보냅니다(`udevd`/`systemd-udevd`가 수신):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329532Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel's `kobject_uevent()` sends netlink messages; udevd receives them and runs rules.",
      "source_hash": 3652908564461290971,
      "context_hash": 2924584167085505395,
      "translation": "커널의 `kobject_uevent()`는 netlink 메시지를 보내며, udevd는 이를 수신하여 규칙을 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:52:54.329532Z",
      "issues": []
    },
